			(property "Description" "-4.0A Id, -30V Vds, P-Channel MOSFET, SOT-23. Real pinout (1=Gate, 2=Source, 3=Drain) verified against AOS's own AO3401A datasheet and cross-checked against distributor pin diagrams; graphics/pin geometry inlined from KiCad's own Transistor_FET:TP0610T base symbol (same SOT-23 P-MOSFET template AO3401A extends in KiCad's default library) rather than using an `extends` relationship, since kicad-cli resolves `extends` via the project's own sym-lib-table and this project does not (and need not) register the stock \"Transistor_FET\" nickname there."
				(at 0 0 0)
