		(property "Description" "Charge-status LED driven by MCP73831 (U2) STAT pin through R10. The MCP73831 typical application circuit shows this LED; this board previously documented it but never placed it, leaving STAT floating with no way to tell charging from charged. Anode to +VBUS-side rail through R10, cathode to STAT (the MCP73831 sinks when charging)."
